function ftheo = CalcFtheo(alpha,p1,p2);x = (log(p2)-log(p1))./(log(p2) + alpha .* log(3));ftheo = ((x-1).*log(x-1) - x .* log(x)) ./(x .* log(1/3));% Written by Maureen Clerc and Jerome Kalifa, 1997% clerc@cmapx.polytechnique.fr, kalifa@cmapx.polytechnique.fr        %   % Part of WaveLab Version 802% Built Sunday, October 3, 1999 8:52:27 AM% This is Copyrighted Material% For Copying permissions see COPYING.m% Comments? e-mail wavelab@stat.stanford.edu%       